What about you?

47
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:17,577
My dearest wish has already come true, so
I'll happily yield mine to everyone else.

48
00:03:17,660 --> 00:03:20,397
If there's a spare, I'll
take a castle of boots.

49
00:03:20,480 --> 00:03:21,737
I don't need anything either.

50
00:03:21,820 --> 00:03:25,497
Just let me eat until I'm about
to burst it, we'll call it even.

51
00:03:25,580 --> 00:03:26,540
Pity had a wish.

52
