Afraid not.

78
00:04:33,840 --> 00:04:36,197
We've been walking a
while, but it's so dark.

79
00:04:36,280 --> 00:04:38,339
Hard to tell how big this place is.

80
00:04:46,480 --> 00:04:48,077
That's about what I expected.

81
00:04:48,160 --> 00:04:51,097
Now the lights are on but nobody's home.

82
00:04:51,180 --> 00:04:54,037
You have done well to
make it here, travelers.

83
00:04:54,120 --> 00:04:58,197
As a reward for reaching
the lowest stratum,

84
00:04:58,280 --> 00:05:01,637
I shall grant you whatever
wish your heart desires. Whoa.

85
00:05:01,720 --> 00:05:03,297
He's really gonna do the thing.

86
00:05:03,380 --> 00:05:06,597
But first, I can sense that one of you.

87
00:05:06,680 --> 00:05:10,856
Your standing before me is more than
capable of threatening my dungeon.

88
00:05:11,040 --> 00:05:12,897
I assume you're referring to me.

89
00:05:12,980 --> 00:05:14,980
I used to work for the Netherlord.

90
00:05:15,740 --> 00:05:16,760
Listen well.

91
00:05:17,140 --> 00:05:21,760
The Netherlord seeks to seize my dungeon
constructed from the sacred tree.

92
00:05:22,320 --> 00:05:24,849
Fool, it's already
stolen most of my power.

93
00:05:24,980 --> 00:05:26,098
Who's that old guy?

94
00:05:28,480 --> 00:05:30,020
Heed my warning!

95
00:05:31,400 --> 00:05:34,937
Talking purple's a real pain, so
how's about I just give it a rest?

96
00:05:35,020 --> 00:05:37,080
Slap my bum and call me Sally!

97
00:05:37,320 --> 00:05:39,037
Never in a million years did I think some

98
00:05:39,120 --> 00:05:41,537
dumb kiddos would show
up and storm my dungeon.

99
00:05:41,620 --> 00:05:43,502
I was about to go on break, too!

100
00:05:44,140 --> 00:05:48,557
He's giving jaded office worker who hates
his life and copes by trolling in forums.

101
00:05:48,640 --> 00:05:50,657
Not how I pictured the Dungeon Master.

102
00:05:50,740 --> 00:05:54,297
I take it you're the one in charge
of this nasty little dungeon?

103
00:05:54,380 --> 00:05:56,204
Well, that's one way to put it.

104
00:05:56,340 --> 00:05:59,017
I'm the guy those in the
know call the Dungeon Master.

105
00:05:59,100 --> 00:05:59,930
Back in the day,

106
00:06:00,013 --> 00:06:03,457
they used to throw around words like
genius and visionary, but I digress.

107
00:06:03,540 --> 00:06:05,280
I'm forgetting my manners.

108
00:06:06,380 --> 00:06:08,100
And look at this table.

109
00:06:08,380 --> 00:06:10,380
Go on, you can rest your keisters.

110
00:06:10,700 --> 00:06:13,437
I'm sure you've got a boatload
of questions to ask me.

111
00:06:13,520 --> 00:06:16,237
I'm an open book, so if
it's in my power to answer?

112
00:06:16,320 --> 00:06:20,277
I don't mind giving you folks the exposition
dump, but let's get some snacks going.

113
00:06:20,360 --> 00:06:21,240
Hello there.

114
00:06:25,020 --> 00:06:26,020
Look at that.

115
00:06:26,200 --> 00:06:27,259
It's my lucky day.

116
00:06:27,460 --> 00:06:30,437
I've always been curious about
these here thingamabobbers.

117
00:06:30,520 --> 00:06:34,217
As a stalwart vending machine, I mean,
I'm the head honcho of feeding folks.

118
00:06:34,300 --> 00:06:38,888
Plus, taking ownership of edibles keeps
my pals safe from any drink tampering.

119
00:06:39,400 --> 00:06:42,517
All right, let's hear what
questions you've got cooking.

120
00:06:42,600 --> 00:06:45,857
Okay, so what's the deal with
dungeons and dungeon masters?

121
00:06:45,940 --> 00:06:47,097
Getting right to it.

122
00:06:47,180 --> 00:06:49,777
Dungeons are basically just
vanglorious works of art.

123
00:06:49,860 --> 00:06:52,757
Created by ancient wizards to
show off our ancient wizardry!

124
00:06:52,840 --> 00:06:53,781
because why not?

125
00:06:54,000 --> 00:06:56,577
Or you could think of them
as recreational facilities.

126
00:06:56,660 --> 00:07:00,337
The dungeon master is the
individual who made the dungeon.

127
00:07:00,420 --> 00:07:02,640
Ancient wizards making dungeon art?

128
00:07:02,840 --> 00:07:05,958
I don't know, seems like I
would have heard about it.

129
00:07:06,220 --> 00:07:08,780
We wizards died out, for reasons.

130
00:07:09,220 --> 00:07:13,277
As a result, history has forgotten
us and the world with it, I'm afraid.

131
00:07:13,360 --> 00:07:14,957
Old wizards made these dungeons,

132
00:07:15,040 --> 00:07:17,697
to brag about how cool they
were for making dungeons?

133
00:07:17,780 --> 00:07:19,074
Are you being serious?

134
00:07:19,440 --> 00:07:21,017
Never would have guessed
this world had its

135
00:07:21,100 --> 00:07:23,512
own equivalent to modern game developers.

136
00:07:23,680 --> 00:07:25,717
Is it true that for
reaching the lowest level,

137
00:07:25,800 --> 00:07:27,957
you'll grant any wish our hearts desire?

138
00:07:28,040 --> 00:07:29,880
Yep, the rumors are true.

139
00:07:31,480 --> 00:07:33,140
How many wishes do we get?

140
00:07:33,480 --> 00:07:36,127
You can technically make
as many as you want.

141
00:07:36,280 --> 00:07:37,398
There's no maximum.

142
00:07:37,660 --> 00:07:41,425
However, that doesn't mean you
can have anything and everything.

143
00:07:41,540 --> 00:07:45,737
Granting a wish consumes an amount of mana
that's proportional to its wow factor.

144
00:07:45,820 --> 00:07:48,357
Which means your wishes
are only limited by the

145
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:51,317
amount of mana contained
within this dungeon of mine.

146
00:07:51,400 --> 00:07:55,480
Do you have the power to remove
my son's negative blessing? I do.

147
00:08:00,920 --> 00:08:01,750
Do it.

148
00:08:01,833 --> 00:08:04,137
I wish for you to free him from his curse.

149
00:08:04,220 --> 00:08:05,777
Better untwist those britches.

150
00:08:05,860 --> 00:08:08,437
I'm not done explaining
all the fine print yet.

151
00:08:08,520 --> 00:08:12,577
Let's say you wish for a bunch of
silver gold and jewels in obscene piles.

152
00:08:12,660 --> 00:08:17,177
I fork over my entire personal treasure
trove without using a single lick of mana.

153
00:08:17,260 --> 00:08:18,090
That said,

154
00:08:18,173 --> 00:08:20,197
removing a negative blessing is gonna eat

155
00:08:20,280 --> 00:08:23,460
up a huge slice of this
dungeon's mana pie. Gotcha.

156
00:08:23,780 --> 00:08:25,545
Then I have one last question.

157
00:08:25,800 --> 00:08:29,600
Can you cure Kai's decay and
also turn Boxxo human again?

158
00:08:29,880 --> 00:08:31,998
I can do it by the skin of my teeth.

159
00:08:32,320 --> 00:08:33,197
But after those two,

160
00:08:33,280 --> 00:08:37,633
I'll be completely out of mana and
unable to grant you any further wishes.

161
00:08:37,940 --> 00:08:40,260
Wait, am I about to rejoin humanity?

162
00:08:40,720 --> 00:08:42,057
Yes, this is for you, Boxxo.

163
00:08:42,140 --> 00:08:43,917
You deserve every happiness, Master.

164
00:08:44,000 --> 00:08:45,297
Congratulations, Boxxo.

165
00:08:45,380 --> 00:08:48,097
Now I can make my wish
with a clear conscience.

166
00:08:48,180 --> 00:08:49,062
It's happening!

167
00:08:49,820 --> 00:08:51,460
One skin for the teeth.

168
00:08:51,780 --> 00:08:54,297
I had my hopes up, but I never
really thought it would happen.

169
00:08:54,380 --> 00:08:56,720
Pinch me, Lamas! Be warned,

170
00:08:56,940 --> 00:08:58,917
if I do grant those wishes of yours,

171
00:08:59,000 --> 00:09:02,235
this dungeon will collapse
and crush everything within.

172
00:09:02,820 --> 00:09:03,860
Wouldn't we die?

173
00:09:04,280 --> 00:09:07,398
Damn, we were this close to
making Boxxo human again.

174
00:09:07,520 --> 00:09:11,037
If the dungeon collapses, it'll flatten
my friends into tragic tortillas.

175
00:09:11,120 --> 00:09:14,532
That price is too steep to
make my selfish wish come true.

176
00:09:14,660 --> 00:09:15,490
Unless...

177
00:09:15,573 --> 00:09:21,140
Ma-enk-you-er-witch-k-a-k-a-k-ang-o-la-ent-er.

178
00:09:22,460 --> 00:09:25,137
You want me to start by
removing the boy's negative

179
00:09:25,220 --> 00:09:27,537
blessing Then you'll
evacuate all your little

180
00:09:27,620 --> 00:09:30,117
friends And make the journey
back here by yourself

181
00:09:30,200 --> 00:09:32,937
Letting you make your wish
guilt-free He's either

182
00:09:33,020 --> 00:09:35,477
amazing at guessing or
he can read my mind like

183
00:09:35,560 --> 00:09:38,177
Kikuyu It seems the Netherlord
has sealed the dungeon

184
00:09:38,260 --> 00:09:41,057
exit just to be a jerk
But I can temporarily

185
00:09:41,140 --> 00:09:44,500
open it again Then we've
got a plan Good thinking,

186
00:09:44,660 --> 00:09:45,940
Boxo Hello there

187
00:09:46,640 --> 00:09:50,460
In that case, I'll go ahead and
remove this boy's curse of decay

188
00:10:05,200 --> 00:10:06,457
The pain is gone.

189
00:10:06,540 --> 00:10:07,620
It's a miracle.

190
00:10:08,020 --> 00:10:10,844
The Scorch's blessing of
decay is gone for good.

191
00:10:11,180 --> 00:10:15,077
He'll never again have to suffer the
torment of feeling his flesh rotting away.

192
00:10:15,160 --> 00:10:16,520
I am in your debt.

193
00:10:16,720 --> 00:10:18,300
At long last, you're free.

194
00:10:18,940 --> 00:10:20,697
There's nothing binding you to me.

195
00:10:20,780 --> 00:10:24,200
I may not need your magic,
but I choose to stay with you.

196
00:10:24,380 --> 00:10:25,674
I hope you don't mind.

197
00:10:31,680 --> 00:10:33,680
I've been waiting for this moment.

198
00:10:34,080 --> 00:10:36,180
So, that's where you were hiding.

199
00:10:44,840 --> 00:10:46,057
Sorry, what gift?

200
00:10:46,140 --> 00:10:48,337
I swear I didn't know about any of this.

201
00:10:48,420 --> 00:10:53,500
Even I never expected this
plan to work out so well!

202
00:11:00,380 --> 00:11:02,597
The fruits of victory are sweet.

203
00:11:02,680 --> 00:11:06,157
Granting such a wish drained
a great deal of his power.

204
00:11:06,240 --> 00:11:09,837
I can now finally extinguish
his life with relative ease.

205
00:11:09,920 --> 00:11:11,260
That's a foul trick!

206
00:11:12,320 --> 00:11:17,200
You can't scoot to such depths just
to get past my anti-monster barrier.

207
00:11:17,480 --> 00:11:20,740
I've sent more of your
power away, Dungeon Master.

208
00:11:21,120 --> 00:11:24,800
Your precious dungeon is
practically in the palm of my hand.

209
00:11:25,180 --> 00:11:27,415
You used me to sneak your way in here?

210
00:11:27,560 --> 00:11:29,520
You're my property.

211
00:11:29,700 --> 00:11:31,760
Why shouldn't I make use of you?

212
00:11:31,940 --> 00:11:34,680
Don't you dare objectify her! Zorin,

213
00:11:35,060 --> 00:11:36,157
given your loyalty,

214
00:11:36,240 --> 00:11:40,760
I'm willing to make an exception
and allow you to return to my side.

215
00:11:42,320 --> 00:11:46,157
The old me would have been more than
happy to go crawling back to you.

216
00:11:46,240 --> 00:11:48,005
But I'm not that girl anymore.

217
00:11:48,780 --> 00:11:51,604
Now I have something
that's far more dear to me.

218
00:11:53,440 --> 00:11:55,280
Sentimental fool. Audrey!

219
00:11:57,740 --> 00:12:00,440
Oh, you erased it with eye breach.

220
00:12:00,980 --> 00:12:04,757
Can't let you kill off a young lady
who might join our family one day.

221
00:12:04,840 --> 00:12:06,075
What's our next move?

222
00:12:06,300 --> 00:12:08,537
We've got the captain's
eye breach and my barrier.

223
00:12:08,620 --> 00:12:12,208
Paired with their gimmicks, we
might actually stand a chance.

224
00:12:14,220 --> 00:12:19,580
It would be amusing to continue this
battle, but I have already achieved my goal.

225
00:12:19,800 --> 00:12:21,880
Let's begin a different game.

226
00:12:22,220 --> 00:12:26,480
The kind of magic has you there
feels like a four on the Richter.

227
00:12:26,620 --> 00:12:28,957
It's freaking them out because
they've never felt an earthquake.

228
00:12:29,040 --> 00:12:32,417
If you keep this up, you'll
cause this dungeon to collapse.

229
00:12:32,500 --> 00:12:34,637
That's exactly what I intend to do.

230
00:12:34,720 --> 00:12:36,660
I got what I came for,

231
00:12:36,840 --> 00:12:40,920
which means I have absolutely no
reason to preserve this place.

232
00:12:41,360 --> 00:12:45,980
I'll move the monsters to the surface
and watch as the humans suffer and die.

233
00:12:48,240 --> 00:12:49,540
What's wrong with you?

234
00:12:49,640 --> 00:12:51,228
Can't you just get a hobby?

235
00:12:51,560 --> 00:12:55,360
Monsters solely exist to
inflict pain and spread sorrow.

236
00:12:56,040 --> 00:12:58,640
The Demon Lord has strayed from this path.

237
00:12:58,860 --> 00:12:59,757
It's pathetic.

238
00:12:59,840 --> 00:13:05,020
I look forward to seeing which comes
first, the collapse or your demise.

239
00:13:05,560 --> 00:13:06,580
He vanished?

240
00:13:06,960 --> 00:13:08,480
Without killing us off?

241
00:13:11,380 --> 00:13:14,968
Listen, I'm going to conjure a
transfer circle for you folks.

242
00:13:15,060 --> 00:13:17,997
It will transport you back to
the Clearflow Lake Stratum.

243
00:13:18,080 --> 00:13:20,780
Go back there and take everyone with you.

244
00:13:21,060 --> 00:13:23,001
Escape the dungeon while you can.

245
00:13:23,340 --> 00:13:25,040
With my remaining power,

246
00:13:25,300 --> 00:13:28,947
I'll release the door leading
to the surface so you can leave.

247
00:13:31,640 --> 00:13:34,464
I don't know how much
longer my power will last,

248
00:13:34,560 --> 00:13:38,325
so it wouldn't be a bad idea to
hot-foot it out of here, got it?

249
00:13:38,560 --> 00:13:41,913
This old man wizard is going
to sacrifice himself for us?

250
00:13:42,020 --> 00:13:47,760
Hey, Boxo, sorry I couldn't grant
your wish and make you a real boy.

251
00:13:48,060 --> 00:13:49,440
You must be devastated.

252
00:13:50,240 --> 00:13:52,560
Ike, H for Ike again.

253
00:13:53,780 --> 00:13:55,660
What a fascinating fella.

254
00:13:56,180 --> 00:13:59,977
I'll try to keep the dungeon from
collapsing for as long as I can,

255
00:14:00,060 --> 00:14:02,001
though I can't make any promises.

256
00:14:02,720 --> 00:14:04,720
What about you, Dungeon Master?

257
00:14:05,380 --> 00:14:07,580
Don't worry, that pretty little head.

258
00:14:07,820 --> 00:14:09,060
This is how it works.

259
00:14:09,420 --> 00:14:11,302
Whenever a dungeon is conquered,

260
00:14:11,500 --> 00:14:14,980
the Dungeon Master grants the
wishes, then vanishes away.

261
00:14:16,600 --> 00:14:19,040
I've lived longer than anyone should.

262
00:14:19,640 --> 00:14:25,140
Didn't expect it to end like this, but at
the very least, it's worth a good laugh.

263
00:14:26,500 --> 00:14:27,740
Say, Poxo,

264
00:14:28,040 --> 00:14:33,760
I know I wasn't able to grant that wish
of yours, but here, a parting gift.

265
00:14:37,480 --> 00:14:40,877
May a promising future
await the brave hunters

266
00:14:40,960 --> 00:14:44,000
who I had the honor of
crossing paths with today.

267
00:14:44,320 --> 00:14:47,420
They who conquered the
dungeon of the Sacred Tree.

268
00:14:48,380 --> 00:14:50,262
Congratulations on your triumph.

269
00:14:50,560 --> 00:14:54,780
Thank you for joining my
dungeon to the very end.

270
00:14:55,300 --> 00:14:58,160
It was a real home and a house.

271
00:15:01,280 --> 00:15:04,177
I never could have imagined
it would come to this.

272
00:15:04,260 --> 00:15:07,157
We need to evacuate everyone
to the Origin Stratum now.

273
00:15:07,240 --> 00:15:08,917
We've got to get them out of this dungeon.

274
00:15:09,000 --> 00:15:09,830
I understand.

275
00:15:11,100 --> 00:15:12,220
Big boss!

276
00:15:13,520 --> 00:15:14,820
We got backup!

277
00:15:15,120 --> 00:15:16,257
Hey, it's the Might Lady!

278
00:15:16,340 --> 00:15:20,281
Lamas, Voxo, our top priority is
securing the door leading outside.

279
00:15:20,420 --> 00:15:21,250
You got it.

280
00:15:21,333 --> 00:15:22,163
Come on, Bear.

281
00:15:22,800 --> 00:15:23,760
Excuse us.

282
00:15:24,020 --> 00:15:25,300
Thank you very much.

283
00:15:39,400 --> 00:15:41,817
Lamas, Director Bear, there's trouble.

284
00:15:41,900 --> 00:15:42,817
What's the issue?

285
00:15:42,900 --> 00:15:45,057
Gross monsters are swarming the village.

286
00:15:45,140 --> 00:15:46,200
There's no choice.

287
00:15:46,340 --> 00:15:48,634
We'll have to evacuate in small groups.

288
00:16:06,300 --> 00:16:10,124
I'll turn you all into charcoal
and use you to warm our clipsies!

289
00:16:11,900 --> 00:16:13,680
Silver King 14! Eat!

290
00:16:14,500 --> 00:16:16,480
Freaking out's a waste of energy.

291
00:16:16,840 --> 00:16:21,252
You've got to keep the calm, cool, and
collected vibes going to yours, too.

292
00:16:23,520 --> 00:16:24,760
Uranu's got game.

293
00:16:37,900 --> 00:16:39,800
We've almost got everyone out.

294
00:16:40,160 --> 00:16:43,513
Methinks our battle montage
will buy us just enough time.

295
00:16:44,760 --> 00:16:47,180
Dang, I wish I had some wood to knock on.

296
00:16:47,380 --> 00:16:50,460
I seem to have underestimated
your team's tenacity.

297
00:16:50,880 --> 00:16:51,940
The big bad.

298
00:16:52,660 --> 00:16:55,080
I find your efforts quite riveting.

299
00:16:55,600 --> 00:16:58,540
So, I'll briefly release
my hold on the door.

300
00:17:07,240 --> 00:17:08,840
It's always so late.

301
00:17:09,340 --> 00:17:12,737
The greatest joy in hunting
comes from cornering your prey.

302
00:17:12,820 --> 00:17:14,640
and watching them squirm.

303
00:17:14,840 --> 00:17:17,040
You're a nasty piece of work, mister.

304
00:17:21,060 --> 00:17:22,800
So, what do we do now?

305
00:17:28,100 --> 00:17:29,140
Please go.

306
00:17:30,160 --> 00:17:31,780
I knew she'd understand.

307
00:17:32,220 --> 00:17:34,300
Now, time for a form change.

308
00:17:35,000 --> 00:17:37,588
Behold the biggest
vending machine in Japan.

309
00:17:39,720 --> 00:17:43,700
Hmm, you dare to defy me,
magic item known as Boxlow?

310
00:17:43,960 --> 00:17:48,360
Even though we're both well aware, you
cannot maintain that form for long.

311
00:17:48,720 --> 00:17:49,560
That's a fact.

312
00:17:49,900 --> 00:17:52,757
Using my barrier in this form
is blowing through my points.

313
00:17:52,840 --> 00:17:54,440
Good thing I'm loaded now.

314
00:17:54,660 --> 00:17:56,097
I've got points to spare.

315
00:17:56,180 --> 00:17:57,220
Thanks to him!

316
00:17:57,420 --> 00:17:59,900
The least I can do is fill your coffers.

317
00:18:00,080 --> 00:18:02,900
Please add this gift to your point total.

318
00:18:03,200 --> 00:18:06,660
The Dungeon Master gifted me
his entire treasure trove.

319
00:18:07,520 --> 00:18:10,017
You wouldn't believe how
many zeroes I'm packing!

320
00:18:10,100 --> 00:18:13,337
I'll keep this barrier up until
every last person gets away!

321
00:18:13,420 --> 00:18:14,280
Hey, Voxo!

322
00:18:14,460 --> 00:18:15,677
What do you think you're doing?

323
00:18:15,760 --> 00:18:17,997
You're gonna get left
behind if you don't stop!

324
00:18:18,080 --> 00:18:20,697
She's not gonna like this,
but it's the only way!

325
00:18:20,780 --> 00:18:25,260
Leave the int to my indigo! I refuse!

326
00:18:25,520 --> 00:18:26,757
I'm not leaving your side!

327
00:18:26,840 --> 00:18:28,437
If you're staying, I am too!

328
00:18:28,520 --> 00:18:32,777
Voxo has a better chance of coming back
safely if we're not around to distract him.

329
00:18:32,860 --> 00:18:34,780
That's it, right? Yes!

330
00:18:35,300 --> 00:18:37,340
I can't leave him! We're a team!

331
00:18:37,520 --> 00:18:38,560
Don't be silly.

332
00:18:38,880 --> 00:18:40,597
You know we'd only be in the way.

333
00:18:40,680 --> 00:18:45,280
So put your faith in him, and
let's go. I don't wanna. I can't.

334
00:18:45,860 --> 00:18:47,400
Don't be sad, Lamas.

335
00:18:47,840 --> 00:18:50,600
Dying's not on my Dead
list, but winning is.

336
00:18:50,840 --> 00:18:54,760
And that's why, no matter what,
I won't let you in the barrier.

337
00:18:55,780 --> 00:18:56,660
Let me in.

338
00:18:56,780 --> 00:18:58,898
I look forward to serving you again.

339
00:19:01,240 --> 00:19:02,157
I give up.

340
00:19:02,240 --> 00:19:04,100
I won't be selfish anymore.

341
00:19:04,880 --> 00:19:07,437
But you'd better come
back to me in one piece.

342
00:19:07,520 --> 00:19:08,540
Hello there.

343
00:19:10,360 --> 00:19:12,880
If you die, I'll kill you.

344
00:19:13,160 --> 00:19:14,680
I'll help you.

345
00:19:15,000 --> 00:19:18,540
Even if you get buried, I promise
I'll come and dig you out.

346
00:19:18,780 --> 00:19:20,898
All you've got to do is wait for me.

347
00:19:21,360 --> 00:19:24,500
You're sacrificing yourself
to save your friends?

348
00:19:24,780 --> 00:19:27,740
Your determination amuses me. Thank you.

349
00:19:28,120 --> 00:19:30,580
I encourage you to consider something.

350
00:19:30,940 --> 00:19:37,020
I have been lurking within the
confines of a bracer upon Saurim's arm.

351
00:19:37,520 --> 00:19:41,597
It is an extension of me and
still very much attached to her.

352
00:19:41,680 --> 00:19:42,510
What's he all about?

353
00:19:42,593 --> 00:19:45,720
I'll show you why this
matters. What's happening?

354
00:19:45,880 --> 00:19:49,660
Voxo and the Netherlord, what
the heck? Didn't we leave?

355
00:19:49,920 --> 00:19:53,508
That jerk forced Solreen to use
her blessing of transference.

356
00:19:54,080 --> 00:19:56,060
Damn you, bony bullies.

357
00:19:57,080 --> 00:19:58,540
Now then, Kerioyl,

358
00:19:58,860 --> 00:20:02,860
I suggest you use your blessing of
Eyebreach to remove that barrier.

359
00:20:03,060 --> 00:20:06,237
Unless you want to watch your
son and future daughter-in-laws.

360
00:20:06,320 --> 00:20:07,580
Let's burst open.

361
00:20:08,400 --> 00:20:10,380
Dad, don't give in.

362
00:20:10,680 --> 00:20:12,640
What a brave son you have.

363
00:20:12,840 --> 00:20:14,240
Now make your choice.

364
00:20:14,600 --> 00:20:17,000
Refuse my command and you both die.

365
00:20:17,240 --> 00:20:19,769
Or erase the barrier
and I'll let you live.

366
00:20:19,980 --> 00:20:21,392
There's no time to lose.

367
00:20:21,660 --> 00:20:25,000
That's why I removed the barrier myself.

368
00:20:26,840 --> 00:20:27,880
Well done.

369
00:20:28,220 --> 00:20:32,520
Let us delight in watching as this
permusing magic item is destroyed.

370
00:20:33,240 --> 00:20:34,277
Don't sweat it, Cap.

371
00:20:34,360 --> 00:20:36,460
I made the call, and that's that.

372
00:20:48,600 --> 00:20:49,800
979 damage.

373
00:20:52,000 --> 00:20:53,580
I'm so sorry.

374
00:20:57,500 --> 00:20:58,880
I'm so...

375
00:20:59,860 --> 00:21:01,117
979 damage.

376
00:21:01,200 --> 00:21:04,440
Durability has been decreased by 979.

377
00:21:04,640 --> 00:21:07,217
You are no longer able to
sustain your current form.

378
00:21:07,300 --> 00:21:08,829
Revenue to original model.

379
00:22:01,540 --> 00:22:02,940
LAMAS

380
00:22:56,100 --> 00:23:01,977
It's a story that I'm going to meet you?

381
00:23:02,060 --> 00:23:04,037
Make a look, make a rendezvous!

382
00:23:04,120 --> 00:23:06,237
Make you wait for me!

383
00:23:06,320 --> 00:23:07,517
I'll be waiting for you!

384
00:23:07,600 --> 00:23:09,600
I'll feel you like you're feeling!

385
00:23:09,840 --> 00:23:12,417
Oh, it's not just a good thing!

386
00:23:12,500 --> 00:23:13,937
I'm gonna be a TV show!

387
00:23:14,020 --> 00:23:16,477
I'm not a good thing!

388
00:23:16,560 --> 00:23:17,717
I don't want to say anything.

389
00:23:17,800 --> 00:23:19,600
I don't want to say anything.

390
00:23:35,800 --> 00:23:38,000
I look forward to serving you again.
